      `the date my first stay began` IS A DATE @desc On what date did you first start to live in the home as your main home?
      `the date my first stay ended` IS A DATE @desc On what date did your first stay in the home as your main home end? If you were still living there when you sold, enter the date of the sale.
      `I lived in it as my main home a second time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc After leaving, did you come back and live in the home as your main home a second time?
      `the date my second stay began` IS A DATE @desc On what date did your second stay begin? If you had no second stay, enter any date.
      `the date my second stay ended` IS A DATE @desc On what date did your second stay end? If you had no second stay, enter any date.
      `I sold another home earlier and left its gain out of my gross income` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before this sale, did you sell or exchange another home and leave its gain out of your gross income under this section?
      `the date of my most recent earlier sale` IS A DATE @desc On what date was your most recent earlier sale of that kind? If you had none, enter any date.
      `I sold because my place of employment changed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you sell because your place of employment changed?
      `I sold by reason of health` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you sell by reason of health?
